  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/0",
      "value": "Skath physiology is a testament to the veracity and efficiency of evolution. The depths of Norkumsgath, their homeworld, is also blessed with enormous pressures and currents that has led to some of the toughest aquatic life anywhere in the galaxy."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/0",
      "value": "スケート生理学は、進化の確実性と効率性の証拠です。 彼らの故郷であるノルクムスガトの深さは、銀河で最も厳しい水生生物のいくつかにつながった膨大な圧力と潮流に祝福されています。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/1",
      "value": "Able to withstand extreme pressures, Skath can reach depths previously thought to be impossible for a species of their particular build. With their natural capability to hold their breath for extended periods of time, it becomes quite clear that they are rooted to an aquatic origin."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/1",
      "value": "極度の圧力に耐えることができるため、スカースは特定のビルドの種にとって不可能と考えられていた深さに達することができます。 長い時間息を吸う自然な能力によって、彼らは水生起源に根ざしていることが明らかになります。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/2",
      "value": "For some reason, despite their aquatic nature the Skath are fully amphibious and have begun living on the surface as well. Many theorize that this is an attempt by their Council to force-start an evolution in their species in order to maximize their persistence among the stars."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/2",
      "value": "なぜか、水生の性質にもかかわらず、スカースは完全に水陸両用であり、水面にも生息し始めました。 多くの人は、これは恒星間の持続性を最大化するために、彼らの種の進化を強制的に開始しようとする彼らの評議会の試みであると理論付けている。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/3",
      "value": "With their change to land-based existence there are challenges every Skath must now face: Humidity and gravity. Without a proper mixture of humidity in the air a Skath will suffer exposure rapidly, leading to their eventual death within a few minutes in some cases. To combat this, Skath have created environmental still-suits to recycle their moisture and keep themselves comfortable."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/3",
      "value": "土地ベースの存在への変化により、すべてのスケースは今直面しなければならない課題があります:湿度と重力。 空気中の適切な湿度の混合物がなければ、スカースは急速に露出し、いくつかのケースでは数分以内に最終的に死亡する。 これに対処するために、スカスは水分をリサイクルし、自分自身を快適に保つための環境用スーツを作成しました。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/4",
      "value": "They are especially susceptible to environmental factors on warmer and dryer worlds, and a simple desert is lethal to a Skath where a Human might simply be uncomfortable. To a Skath, remaining moist is imperative."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/4",
      "value": "温暖で乾燥した世界の環境要因に特に影響を受けやすく、単純な砂漠は人間が単に不快である可能性があるスケートに致命的です。 スカースにとって、残った水分は必須です。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/5",
      "value": "As for spawning young: the Skath have at least kept this part of their species unchanged despite the swap to newer climates. Females lay between six and twenty eggs, fertilized by the males during spawning season, which both partners aid in protecting until they hatch. At this point, both are responsible for the teaching of young."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/5",
      "value": "若い子を産むことについては、スカースは少なくとも、新しい気候に取って代わったにもかかわらず、彼らの種のこの部分を変化させていない。 雌は産卵期の間に雄によって受精する卵を六個から二〇個産み、両者は産卵まで保護する。 この時点で、どちらも若者の教育を担当しています。"
    }
  ],
  [
    {
      "op": "test",
      "path": "/contentPages/6",
      "value": "Priority is placed on social and combat skills, both of which are essential to survival among their people. Typically the young reach formal adulthood within only two years! This makes the Skath the fastest populating race in the known galaxy next to the Thelusians (which is of great concern to the Protectorate due to the Affordance Treaties of 2331)."
    },
    {
      "op": "replace",
      "path": "/contentPages/6",
      "value": "優先度は社会的スキルと戦闘スキルに置かれ、どちらも彼らの人々の生存に不可欠です。 通常、二年以内に若者が正式な成人に達する! これにより、スカースはテルシアンの隣の既知の銀河で最速の人口を持つ(これは、2331の努力条約のために保護国にとって大きな関心事である)。"
    }
  ],
